<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: mycothread -->
  <VPE_Mycothread.label>菌絲布</VPE_Mycothread.label>
  <!-- EN: Cotton-like, edible fabric extracted from mycothread mushrooms. It’s soft to the touch and easy to work with, deteriorates quickly, has an unusual color, and oddly still smells and tastes like mushrooms. -->
  <VPE_Mycothread.description>纖維菇里提取出來的菌絲織物，可以食用。它觸感柔軟，方便加工，老化迅速，有一種獨特的顏色。難得的是，它還能被當作蘑菇食用。</VPE_Mycothread.description>
  
</LanguageData>